DESCRIPTION:The University of West Florida Athletics program and its Alumn
 i Association run the Argos Aim High clay shoot fundraiser. It's held at 
 the Santa Rosa Shooting Center in Pace. Teams of four enter for $750\, wi
 th breakfast at check-in\, plus lunch and awards after. Registration and 
 breakfast start at 7:30 AM\, a mandatory safety briefing follows at 8:30 
 AM\, and the tournament starts at 9:00 AM. Shooters bring their own shotg
 un\, ammunition\, and eye and ear protection\; shells are limited to No. 
 7.5\, 8 or 9 shot. A rain date of December 4\, 2026 covers an October was
 hout.\nPrice: from $750\nArea: Milton & Pace\nTimes: Friday 10/9 · Regis
